WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 4.5 · People, Culture & Volunteers
Check-ins, performance and development

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Regular short check-ins, objectives linked to strategy and fair handling of concerns build performance.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Hold short check-ins every week or fortnight.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Link each objective to an organisational objective.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Keep wellbeing talks apart from performance judgements.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Vanita Weavers Cooperative (Cooperative · member-owned, India)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Designer: two collections woven by 30 members, every design online within a month; development goal: a natural dyeing course.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create your check-in rhythm and objectives for one role.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
